{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into a fortress labyrinth crawling with monsters, defending yourself with your... tongue? As a frog, it's your best bet to traverse this retro-inspired 2D metroidvania title. Collect treasures to gain permanent upgrades to your moveset, and discover new areas of the massive interconnected map with them! A plethora of secrets await in unlikely locations...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With your tongue, you can engage in precise combat, using a slew of equippable tongue-whips and secondary weapons to your advantage. You'll need them when facing intimidating bosses with complex attack patterns. Customize your stats with a variety of item pickups to build a playstyle you prefer!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The lakeside castle awaits your arrival... Will you heed its call and brave the night?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3744870?t=1772628428","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3744870/2bc6776bacc0175188f10cd22b41572cd6a9074b/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772628428","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3744870/ccdc68c7c1f0f6a941275b63e8a96f76ee6abb47/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772628428","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3744870/ccdc68c7c1f0f6a941275b63e8a96f76ee6abb47/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772628428","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":4020560,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into a fortress labyrinth crawling with monsters, defending yourself with your... tongue? As a frog, it's your best bet to traverse this retro-inspired 2D met